{"doc_id": "doc5159", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Cyndi Grecco, born May 19, 1952, in New York, New York, is an American singer who performed the theme tune to the popular 1970s American television show Laverne & Shirley. Titled \"Making Our Dreams Come True\", the song (in which Grecco was accompanied by the Ron Hicklin Singers) was also put out as a single and charted at #25 on July 25, 1976. The song came out on the small Private Stock label (#45086). An album followed, though a second disco-themed single, \"Dancing, Dancing\", failed to chart. She also provided the theme to another 1970s ABC television sitcom Blansky's Beauties. Nevertheless, Grecco remains a one-hit wonder.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 860992035, "similarity": 0.995260663507109, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "5fe40c6b3baa6b947b13e6bee243c2e4efdce526ab243b11feb2f2276529d72b", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "Cyndi Grecco", "matched_aliases": ["Cyndi Grecco"], "query_id": "test136", "question_hash": "43be20fd76d880cde68a25930fba370a9043e20edec4bb47b7ba71b2427e5f5e", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "retry_seed": 0, "row_hash": "0da60a913b608f094ac27b7d18d94c030913bd9cfd51a864fd593090949d951e", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 436214416, "similarity": 0.22782608695652173, "source_content_hash": "ca68023256ba87da76982659dc35bbc562402fb42bb53208c5b977bd931e5b34", "source_hash": "fd6775cb8456c37e4bcf469e4c3a225159e49e0af4c5746f671711f9eaa5447c", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "895a7bc8a253615601753d5aa5454b091048127ff4f4546cfe125a1cc9e9b8df", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc5160", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "The Lykan Hypersport is a Lebanese limited production supercar built by W Motors, a United Arab Emirates based company, founded in 2012 in Lebanon with the collaboration of Lebanese, French, and Italian engineers. It is the first supercar to be produced in the Middle East, and is featured in the film Furious 7, and the video games Project CARS, Driveclub, Asphalt 8: Airborne, Asphalt Nitro, Forza Motorsport 6, and GT Racing 2: The Real Car Experience, Forza Horizon 3, CSR Racing and CSR Racing 2. The Lykan can also be briefly seen in the second Fate of the Furious trailer, however, the Lykan does not make an appearance, the footage is from the seventh movie, Fast and Furious 7. It is the first car to be designed and produced indigenously in the Arab World. The Lykan Hypersport.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 812660329, "similarity": 0.9776357827476039, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "5fc6493724b1bdbefe36277e0751196a958dcf2992a7635c92c0510549d7f80a", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "The Lykan Hypersport", "matched_aliases": ["The Lykan Hypersport"], "query_id": "test137", "question_hash": "d10acccf7e003075dd5e9cb399f60aa9207a1ea8ee30e7ea9332523275e25e11", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "retry_seed": 0, "row_hash": "b27636cdd0ca8389e931db2d260298aab8a4097ff98b4a4b57b67cc3896d2f34", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 664394882, "similarity": 0.07132867132867132, "source_content_hash": "63a41f6a8a4b2821197e7410718dea7560123d126c8b3d49bb91dc1fd31593fe", "source_hash": "09d570d441a67603845defa792c00873ce2b57db039db8def947502301823a4c", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "06317e667d983f8cd3758e9132999f61e204663159ec7099ff82b95fde198714", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_