{"doc_id": "doc70508", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "In the season ten episode \"Nelson's Sparrow\", Gideon was murdered off-screen, having been shot dead at a close range by a serial killer named Donnie Mallick (Arye Gross), which prompts the BAU team to investigate Gideon's murder. During the flashbacks focusing on a young version of him for the episode which show him working at the BAU in 1978, he is played by Ben Savage.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1748958950, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.3}, {"attempt": 2, "generated_text": "Gideon's death occurs in the season ten episode titled \"Nelson's Sparrow,\" where he is killed off-screen by a serial killer named Donnie Mallick, who shoots him at close range. The episode features flashbacks set in 1978 that depict a younger Gideon working at the BAU, portrayed by Ben Savage.", "reason": "missing_gold_answer", "seed": 302657857, "similarity": null, "temperature": 0.5}], "fingerprint": "bd12cb5d49d18a99864b34bd286c7e5ff2ecbbe22b5d663d991e90ae17f22b05", "generation_attempts": 3, "gold_answer": "\"Nelson's Sparrow\"", "matched_aliases": ["\"Nelson's Sparrow\""], "query_id": "test2013", "question_hash": "1f52896b020e34aa2258c35966a91f2d625365bb8dd622caa53fde04ddaa7def", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "retry_seed": 0, "row_hash": "b81731756a919c9ef2a48f4cc223001a8ef8a12c7e9b87acb1ace968c30071a9", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 1153585582, "similarity": 0.3236994219653179, "source_content_hash": "904537dd5531eb740d972f569d5aba931ffcde1e5f41decaaee421999745b83e", "source_hash": "7f76c88964b4e9501103f56d20b37a547a6c5eda11cb69df3ebe6219ef51ba56", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.7, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "c1480b22bee077fb2a7b96a21b7e9e44a3e18ed8c0f165d672ca1f7993994db4", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not