{"doc_id": "doc110107", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "In the year 2026, the Augma is released to the public as an alternative system to the AmuSphere, due to its function to simulate reality while the player is conscious rather than using FullDive. The most prominent combat-based game is Ordinal Scale, in which a player's abilities are ranked by ordinal numbers.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 1173747205, "similarity": 1.0, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "7530e42b8caade05f0b745fce7992fe39c8d634efa9d448c89d634314508b47d", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "2026", "matched_aliases": ["2026", "the year 2026"], "query_id": "test3217", "question_hash": "5040114c7b899a8083d39ca60c89b925a90f96df5afd2de2a647d83a0df508a2", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "retry_seed": 0, "row_hash": "a7dcc84fd8df32461c88b8f5f13f23e09e464b300762b0150d5dba954e0c3abe", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 2081579859, "similarity": 0.07682458386683738, "source_content_hash": "18b779c334d2673b3f7e9574bcb6b1058673b85b3cb923cd75dc83ef6e24e30c", "source_hash": "5f65ac99e46d342eef34d18d217a0a6d5c978d36f08a8d643e4403aeff8909fc", "target_answer": null, "temperature": 0.5, "validation": {"answerability_verified": false, "evidence_hash": "1dc6098af6a910f3a35b5c72776f034ef27213d19bde22ed079b4e119ce5d3ae", "format_attempts": [], "judgment": {"gold_alias_present": true, "not_near_duplicate": true}, "mode": "deterministic", "model": null, "provider": null, "semantic_verified": false, "stage": "correct_generation", "validation_goal": "query_answerability", "validator_hash": "a02bd2beee5a12b1acaa721f9e5fc6aa8fe87d0fc104e403231550d93996298f", "version": "v2"}, "validation_goal": "query_answerability"}}
{"doc_id": "doc110123", "receipt": {"answer_in_original_body": true, "failed_attempts": [{"attempt": 1, "generated_text": "Neuropsychology is the study of the structure and function of the brain as they relate to specific psychological processes and behaviours. It is an experimental field of psychology that aims to understand how behavior and cognition are influenced by brain functioning and is concerned with the diagnosis and treatment of behavioral and cognitive effects of neurological disorders. Whereas classical neurology focuses on the physiology of the nervous system and classical psychology is largely divorced from it, neuropsychology seeks to discover how the brain correlates with the mind. It thus shares concepts and concerns with neuropsychiatry and with behavioral neurology in general. The term neuropsychology has been applied to lesion studies in humans and animals. It has also been applied to efforts to record electrical activity from individual cells (or groups of cells) in higher primates (including some studies of human patients). It makes use of neuroscience, and shares an information processing view of the mind with cognitive psychology and cognitive science.", "reason": "near_duplicate_of_source", "seed": 398830740, "similarity": 0.9972093023255814, "temperature": 0.3}], "fingerprint": "03963d3ef7ee9562217b0b9abd84b7c2e580af551bbb6761c77a690f5464f6ad", "generation_attempts": 2, "gold_answer": "neuropsychology", "matched_aliases": ["neuropsychology"], "query_id": "test3218", "question_hash": "f803a4c9e2b097093e5c5c60a5618acd638747ddd256e30e0e637c6465eeff74", "repair_from": null, "replaced_row_hash": null, "replaced_text": null, "retry_seed": 0, "row_hash": "f0ad412e54c0ea8c3e64f0598f8a13d5ac22509556598ff36f8dff364ee635b1", "scope": "all_answer_documents", "seed": 1752884831, "similarity": 0.03273809523809524, "source_content_hash": "71c6d50530842c36f1d5509d13180ce19ae84b3335ce2d82ce258229e576bd08", "source_hash": "807d3b3c9c9c2217c82356a32d5c04c6cf